OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMost of the dry will be dry,
OL,6,Fsome brighter spells along the east
OL,7,Fcoast. Rain will spread east later in
OL,8,Fthe afternoon. Warm in any brightness.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FTurning cloudy with outbreaks
OL,11,Fof rain spreading east through the
OL,12,Fevening and overnight, rain heavy at
OL,13,Ftimes. Mainly dry by morning with just
OL,14,Fthe odd shower and some clear spells.
OL,15,
OL,16,CTuesday:FBright spells and some
OL,17,Fshowers through the day, the odd one
OL,18,Fturning heavy in the afternoon. Best
OL,19,Fof the dry, bright weather in the
OL,20,Fsoutheast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
