OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FThe
OL,6,Fodd shower Wednesday, but mainly dry
OL,7,Fand bright. A band of heavy rain
OL,8,Fpushes east Wednesday night. Bright
OL,9,Fspells and showers Thursday, easing
OL,10,FFriday morning, then further rain
OL,11,Flater.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
